title: The Left returns
new-page: true

= The Left returns

Lewica returns with **12.56% and 49 deputies**. Its SLD, Wiosna, Razem,
trade-union and feminist currents agree on a list, not on who controls it.

PiS governs, Duda seeks re-election and every opposition party contests the
same Polish electorates.

The chapter runs from **October 2019 through July 2023**. A party deck and,
when applicable, a government deck feed a persistent three-card hand. Play one
card per month; advisor groups use their own cooldown.

- @poland_hub: Convene the leadership
